stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Development: Feature Implementation & Bug Fixes
    
    Development --> LocalPreflight: Pre-Release Quality Gates
    state LocalPreflight {
        [*] --> CheckBuild: npm run build
        CheckBuild --> CheckTests: npm test (192 unit tests)
        CheckTests --> CheckKnowledge: npm run validate:knowledge
        CheckKnowledge --> CheckRetrieval: npm run evaluate:retrieval
        CheckRetrieval --> [*]
    }
    
    LocalPreflight --> ReleaseCandidate: Gates Pass 100%
    note right of ReleaseCandidate
        Release package prepared at:
        releases/v0.1.0/
        Status: RELEASE CANDIDATE (Draft)
    end note
    
    ReleaseCandidate --> StagedCommit: Single Clean Git Commit
    StagedCommit --> GitHubBranch: Push to main branch
    
    GitHubBranch --> AutomatedCI: GitHub Actions CI Matrix
    AutomatedCI --> ProductionDeploy: CI Passes & Owner Manual Approval
    
    state ProductionDeploy {
        DeployBackend: Deploy Render Web Service
        HealthCheck: curl -f /health probe
        DeployFrontend: Deploy Render Static Site
        BrowserQA: Manual E2E User Flow Verification
        
        DeployBackend --> HealthCheck
        HealthCheck --> DeployFrontend
        DeployFrontend --> BrowserQA
    }
    
    ProductionDeploy --> OfficialRelease: Smoke Tests Pass
    OfficialRelease --> TagRelease: Git Tag v0.1.0 & GitHub Release Published
    TagRelease --> PostReleaseMonitoring: Sentry / Logs / User Feedback
    PostReleaseMonitoring --> [*]
